        {
            "id": "about",
            "type": "page",
            "title": "About Peter",
            "menu": "About",
            "visible": true,
            "layout": "side",
            "body": "<p><strong>Peter Beyer Architect</strong> is qualified as an architect with the Australian Institute of Architects, with previous overseas experience and British Royal Institute of Architects and Berlin Architektenkammer affiliations.</p><h3>Design</h3><p>High quality, good value, efficient construction and green environmental design.</p><h3>Works</h3><p>From residential and commercial to complex institutional projects, mining infrastructure and accommodation.</p><h3>Additional expertise</h3><ul><li>Specialist progress and construction advice and reports</li><li>Dilapidation surveys</li><li>Pre-purchase and owner-builder insurance inspections, metropolitan and country</li></ul><blockquote>“Listen to many, speak to a few.” — William Shakespeare</blockquote>",
            "images": [
